<view class="content"><view class="title">uniCloud 基础示例</view><view class="tips"><view>1.在cloudfunctions目录右键创建并关联服务空间</view><view>2.在cloudfunctions目录内db_init.json上右键初始化云数据库</view><view>3.在cloudfunctions目录右键选择“上传所有云函数”</view><view>开始愉快的体验uniCloud吧！</view></view><view class="btn-list"><button type="primary" bindtap="{{a}}">新增一条数据</button><button type="primary" bindtap="{{b}}">删除一条数据</button><button type="primary" bindtap="{{c}}">修改数据</button><button type="primary" bindtap="{{d}}">查询前10条数据</button><button type="primary" bindtap="{{e}}">使用公用模块</button><button type="primary" bindtap="{{f}}">上传文件</button></view></view>